id":"call_00_tCXqQUUhxAtqTslLUJjF5917","name":"edit_dut","argumentsDelta":"}"},{"type":"block-end","index":0,"block":{"type":"reasoning","text":"The DUT has a bug: clamping to 126 instead of 127. Fix that.\n\nLet me write the corrected module.\n\nThe sum of two signed 8-bit values ranges [-256, 254], needs 9 bits. extended as {a[7],a}+{b[7],b} is 9 bits signed. Correct.\n\nFix: else if(extended>127) sum<=127.\n\nLet me do the edit."}},{"type":"block-end","index":1,"block":{"type":"tool-call","id":"call_00_tCXqQUUhxAtqTslLUJjF5917","name":"edit_dut","arguments":"{\"expected_revision_id\": \"99bd1c64-d109-4c21-9098-ea9fac75bf62\", \"source\": \"module signed_saturating_add(input clk,rst,input signed [7:0] a,b,output reg signed [7:0] sum);\\nwire signed [8:0] extended={a[7],a}+{b[7],b};\\nalways @(posedge clk) if(rst) sum<=0; else if(extended>127) sum<=127; else if(extended< -128) sum<= -128; else sum<=extended[7:0];\\nendmodule\\n\"}"}},{"type":"usage","usage":{"inputTokens":592,"outputTokens":276,"totalTokens":1636,"cacheReadTokens":768,"reasoningTokens":91}},{"type":"finish","reason":{"kind":"tool-calls"}}]